## Key Modules and Relationships

| Module | Language | Role |
|--------|----------|------|
| `memory-bus.ps1` | PowerShell | Entry point; runs SyncAll, refreshes derived artifacts |
| `memory-watchdog.ps1` | PowerShell | Background daemon; monitors sources, triggers sync |
| `omni-memory-server.js` | Node.js | Shared MCP server; HTTP transport, tool dispatch |
| `build-memory-layers.js` | Node.js | Builds MEMORY-LAYERS artifact from structured JSONL |
| `build-handoff-pack.js` | Node.js | Builds bounded HANDOFF packet for next agent |
| `run-memory-dream.ps1` | PowerShell | Consolidation pass; typed durable promotion |
| `generate-embeddings.js` | Node.js | Generates BM25 + dense embeddings index |
| `semantic-search.py` | Python | Retrieval: BM25 + dense + hybrid + MMR + rerank |
| `entity-extractor.js` | Node.js | Two-pass entity detection (person/project/concept) |
| `knowledge-graph.js` | Node.js | KG triple storage in SQLite with temporal validity |
| `obsidian-blackboard-daemon.js` | Node.js | Chokidar watch on vault notes |
| `sync-openclaw-to-obsidian.js` | Node.js | Imports OpenClaw sessions/runs/blackboard |
